    "text": "KLTV\nwebsite\nSmith County, Texas\nMan arrested after Smith County runaway found safe\nBy KLTV Digital Media Staff,\n3 hours agoTYLER, Texas (KLTV) - A teenager who had left home on Saturday and was reported missing by her family has been located. Abby Morales, 15, has been located and is safe, the Smith County Sheriff’s Office said. They added that she is in the process of being reunited with her family.\n6",
